<title>UK: India buys 12,000 tonnes palm olein - trade.</title>
<headline>India buys 12,000 tonnes palm olein - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's State Trading Corporation (STC) purchased a total of 12,000 tonnes of palm olein at it's tender on Tuesday, European vegetable oil traders said.</p>
<p>The STC bought one parcel for first half October shipment at $585 a tonne cost and freight and a further parcel at $581 a tonne c and f for second half November shipment, traders said.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
